{
  "slug": "wu-whatsapp",
  "name": "Wu Whatsapp",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "WhatsApp integration for Claude Code — send messages, search chats, manage groups via wu-cli",
  "longDescription": "Ships **14 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Commands** (14): `backfill` (Backfill older message history), `chats` (List WhatsApp chats), `communities` (List WhatsApp Communities and their subgroups), `contacts` (List WhatsApp contacts), `context` (Get surrounding message context), `count` (Count WhatsApp messages in a chat), `dms` (List 1:1 (direct message) WhatsApp chats), `export` (Export WhatsApp messages to a file), and 6 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `wu`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install wu-whatsapp@claude-community` from `ibrahimhajjaj/wu-cli` (`claude-plugin`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
